WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.971
Thank you for shaping this little instrument with us.

00:00:05.971 --> 00:00:14.828
Mutable Dreams one point four opens forty-eight new Biomes, each an invitation to find a different sound.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.292
Turn the preset wheel.

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:32.584
The next world can be a pulse, a bass line, or a wide, resonant space.

00:00:32.584 --> 00:00:38.418
The existing Biomes and your saved worlds stay in place.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:49.395
A small request made the Home screen clearer.

00:00:49.395 --> 00:00:57.307
Muted tracks now fade across their whole row and meter, with a clear muted label.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:13.453
Five new scales bring unfamiliar colour to your sequences and chords.

00:01:13.453 --> 00:01:20.653
Try Ukrainian Dorian, Harmonic Minor, or either of the Double Harmonic modes.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:36.302
Give every track its own MIDI channel, share a channel, or turn note input off.

00:01:36.302 --> 00:01:44.066
Play it on the F M one, or open the full instrument and live editor in your browser.

00:01:44.066 --> 00:01:47.948
Thank you for keeping these worlds moving.
